      "question_text": "Polyhydramnios is associated with?",
      "options": {
        "A": "Renal agenesis",
        "B": "Anencephaly and GI atresias",
        "C": "Post-term pregnancy",
        "D": "IUGR"
      },
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Polyhydramnios (AFI >25): impaired fetal swallowing (anencephaly, esophageal/duodenal atresia) or increased production. Oligohydramnios: decreased fetal urine output (renal agenesis = Potter sequence)."
    },
