      "question_text": "Normal fetal heart rate range?",
      "options": {
        "A": "100-120 bpm",
        "B": "110-160 bpm",
        "C": "160-200 bpm",
        "D": "80-100 bpm"
      },
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Normal FHR: 110-160 bpm. Tachycardia >160, bradycardia <110. Baseline variability 6-25 bpm = normal. Loss of variability + late decelerations = fetal distress."
